{"hw":"ἀναγκαῖον","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀναγκαῖον</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀναγκ-αῖον</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">τό</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">place of constraint, prison,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">HG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.4.8</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Harp.</span> </span>, who adds <span class=\"gk\">Καλλισθένης δὲ ἀνώγεων εἶπεν, ὃ δεῖ μᾶλλον λέγεσθαι</span>: but correct reading is prob. <span class=\"gk\">ἀνάκαιον</span> (preserved in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Suid.</span> </span> and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">AB</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">98</span> </span>, as used by Boeotians), or <span class=\"gk\">Ἀνάκειον,</span> q. v., as in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">45.80</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EM</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">98.32</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> = αἰδοῖον, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Artem.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.45</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Eust.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1968.39</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cat.Cod.Astr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8(4).133</span> </span> (pl.). </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">III</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">privy,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gloss.</span> </span> </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">IV</span> <abbr>=</abbr> sq., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plaut.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rud.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">363</span> </span>.</div></div>"}